        "**Step 2: 🏷️ Classify Everything**\n",
        "> **Logic:** Run 4 separate passes.\n",
        "> 1.  **Feelings:** Check Sentiment & Emotion.\n",
        "> 2.  **Safety:** Check `is_spam`.\n",
        "> 3.  **Intent:** Check `is_question`.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 3: 🤖 The Smart Agent (The Writer)**\n",
        "> **Class:** `SmartReplyAgent`\n",
        "> This is a logic gate. It looks at the results from Step 2.\n",
        "> *   **Rule:** If the comment is **SPAM** or **NEGATIVE** -> Do nothing.\n",
        "> *   **Rule:** If the comment is a **QUESTION** or **POSITIVE** -> Activate **Flan-T5** to generate a helpful or friendly reply based on the comment text.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 4: 💾 Save Predictions**\n",
        "> **Logic:** `to_parquet`\n",
        "> It saves all these new AI insights into a final file, which will be used by the Dashboard in Module 5 to visualize the data."
