        "\n",
        "### 1. What it does\n",
        "This module is the **Presentation Layer**. It takes all the hard work from the previous modules (Scraper, Spark, AI) and turns it into a clear, actionable **Report Card** specifically designed for a YouTube Creator.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Why it exists\n",
        "Raw data (Excel sheets, Parquet files) is boring and hard to read. Creators want answers, not numbers. This module \"translates\" the data into **Graphs** and **Strategy Advice** (e.g., \"Film this next,\" \"Reply to this person\").\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. How it works\n",
        "It reads the final processed data (`comments_classified.parquet`) and generates two things:\n",
        "1.  **Visual Dashboard:** A giant grid of 12 charts showing Sentiment, Emotions, Topics, and Activity.\n",
        "2.  **Creator Strategy Report:** A text-based summary that acts like a \"Digital Consultant,\" giving specific tips on what to do next.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4. Algorithms Involved\n",
        "*   **Seaborn/Matplotlib:** Libraries used to draw the 12 specific charts.\n",
        "*   **NLTK (Natural Language Toolkit):** Used to extract **SEO Keywords** by filtering out boring words (stopwords) and finding the most common meaningful words.\n",
        "*   **Logic Heuristics:** Simple \"If/Then\" rules used to generate advice (e.g., *IF positive_ratio > 5 THEN print \"Audience loves this\"*).\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. Final Output\n",
        "*   **The Mega-Dashboard:** A large image displaying 12 key metrics (Sentiment Pie Chart, Word Cloud, Activity Timeline, etc.).\n",
        "*   **The Strategy Report:** A printed analysis covering \"The Vibe Check,\" \"Content Gaps,\" \"Superfan Spotlight,\" and \"Next Video Ideas.\"\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### ⚙️ **The Pipeline Logic (Step-by-Step)**\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the flow of the code:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 1: 🏁 The Setup**\n",
        "> **Function:** `run_full_analysis`\n",
        "> This is the \"Master Button.\" It asks for a URL and then triggers the entire chain:\n",
        "> **Module 1 (Scrape) -> Module 2 (Spark) -> Module 3 (AI) -> Module 5 (Dashboard).**\n",
        "> *Note: It skips Module 4 (Fine-tuning) in the live demo for speed.*\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 2: 🖼️ The Visuals (12-Grid Plot)**\n",
        "> **Function:** `generate_mega_dashboard`\n",
        "> It draws a massive image with 12 charts:\n",
        "> *   **Row 1:** Sentiment Pie, Word Cloud, Volume over Time.\n",
        "> *   **Row 2:** Top Emotions, Topic Popularity, Sentiment per Topic.\n",
        "> *   **Row 3:** Do longer comments get more likes? Are people asking questions?\n",
        "> *   **Row 4:** Who are the top fans? Is there spam? Are there AI reply drafts?\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 3: 📢 The Strategy Report (The Consultant)**\n",
        "> **Function:** `print_creator_report`\n",
        "> This function prints a human-readable analysis. It answers 10 specific questions for the creator:\n",
        "> 1.  **Vibe Check:** Is the video a hit or a miss?\n",
        "> 2.  **Burning Questions:** What are viewers asking? (Gives you content ideas).\n",
        "> 3.  **The \"Money\" Topic:** Which topic gets the most likes?\n",
        "> 4.  **Superfan:** Who commented the most? (So you can thank them).\n",
        "> 5.  **SEO:** What tags should you add to the description?\n",
        "> 6.  **Timing:** When is your audience most active?\n",
        "> 7.  **Next Video Idea:** It combines the Top Topic + \"Q&A\" to suggest a title for your next video.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 4: ✅ Final Dump**\n",
        "> It prints the first 20 rows of the final data so you can inspect the raw results if needed."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "nq3LnMgG9yDC"
      }
